@@text Run 2026-11-01 (rcs234, [scratch_run_2026-11-01.md](scratch_run_2026-11-01.md) 7): SQ-CBJ4-01 to -07 PASS. -05 needs a long wait: `jitterSeconds = 120` puts the first roll up to 130 s out and the poison lasts 4 s (poll every 2 s past `ce_copper_poison_roll`); -07 on iron golems (perfBot bots are invulnerable). Client rows open.
@@text
@@text Run after SQ-CS2 and SQ-CMP pass (waves 2 and 3 are the base). Jars: `creativeengineering-1.1.07.jar` and the rebuilt
@@text `creativebrewing-1.0.0.jar` together (CB requires `[1.1.07,)`), with the wave 4 script moves (phase 1) in the same jar.
@@text Scratch copy: edit one value in each moved section of `creativeengineering-common.toml` before the boot (`[alcohol]
@@text quarkLine = false`, `[magic_resistance] reductionPerLevel = 0.3`) and delete those four sections from the scratch
@@text `creativebrewing-common.toml` if present, so the merge path runs. (The instance's own config was moved by hand: CE file
@@text without the four sections, CB file with them.)
